  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: E7
  Title: Apply From Values Immediately
  Summary: Each title fades in from invisible after a 0.8 s delay. One animation
    has the setting on, the other off.
  Watch: On, Off
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1506812041}
  - {fileID: 1068442757}
  HowTo: In play mode, click <b>Show On</b>, then <b>Show Off</b>. Then preview both
    with the Play buttons.
  Expect: 'Play mode: Show On blinks the title out at once and fades it in 0.8 s
    later. Show Off leaves the title visible for 0.8 s, then snaps it invisible and
    fades it in - the flash this setting prevents. The preview always starts from
    the first frame, so both look like Show On there.'
  Needs: 3
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
  Width: 620
  StageHeight: 280
