  - {fileID: 898979862}
  - {fileID: 908815754}
  HowTo: Play <b>Three Times</b>. Play <b>Forever</b>, then press Stop and Restore.
  Expect: Three Times crosses three times, jumping back to the left between crossings,
    and stops on the right. Forever swings back and forth until stopped.
