  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: E8
  Title: The Reset button
  Summary: 'Reset jumps to an animation''s first frame without playing: steps with
    a From jump to it, the rest stay put.'
  Watch: With From, No From
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1812493563}
  - {fileID: 623214348}
  HowTo: Press <b>Reset</b> beside Appear. Then Play. Then Stop and Restore.
  Expect: 'Reset: With From vanishes (scale 0); No From doesn''t change. Play: With
    From pops in, No From grows to 1.4. Stop and Restore puts both back at 1.'
  Needs: 1
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
