  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: E5
  Title: 'From: Absolute and Baseline'
  Summary: A From in Baseline mode follows the element when you move it; an Absolute
    one doesn't.
  Watch: Absolute, Baseline
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 799251959}
  - {fileID: 501672255}
  HowTo: Play <b>Slide In</b>. Stop and Restore. Move both boxes 100 to the right
    in the Scene view (or add 100 to Pos X), then Play again. Undo the move afterwards.
  Expect: 'First play: both slide in from the left to rest. After moving them: Baseline
    still starts 300 left of where it now rests; Absolute still starts at x -200,
    so its slide is longer. Both end where they now rest.'
  Needs: 9
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
