  m_text: '<b>Expect:</b> The From row shows Current with a tooltip explaining it.
    Opening the dropdown doesn''t offer Current. Play ignores the From of -500: Box
    slides from where it is to 200 right of rest. Nothing is rewritten.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
